            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co ten kod wyświetla w konsoli? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które dłuższe przypisanie zaktualizowałoby <code>marbles</code> w taki sam sposób jak drugi wiersz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>marbles = marbles + 2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>marbles = 2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>marbles = marbles - 2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>marbles = marbles + 2</code>.</p></body></html>",
